        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "HOGGING: wave CREST amidships          SAGGING: wave TROUGH amidships\n   (extra buoyancy in the middle)         (extra buoyancy at the ends)"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SHIP-STRUCTURES.md#013",
      "path": [
        "04-SHIP-STRUCTURES.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
