      },
      "text": "___---^^^---___  wave crest             wave              wave\n       /               \\                       crest             crest\n   ~~~/~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\\~~~ surface       ~~~\\~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~/~~~ surface\n   +===================+         +===================+\n   |  hull bends DOWN  |         |  \\  trough   /    |\n   |  at the ends      |         |   \\________/      |\n   +===================+         +===================+\n    ends droop, middle up                  ends up, middle droops\n    DECK in TENSION                         DECK in COMPRESSION\n    BOTTOM in COMPRESSION                   BOTTOM in TENSION\n```"
    },
    {
