      "text": "load:     q(x) = buoyancy(x) - weight(x)        [force / length]\n        shear:    Q(x) = integral of q(x) dx\n        moment:   M(x) = integral of Q(x) dx            (max amidships, usually)"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SHIP-STRUCTURES.md#016",
      "path": [
        "04-SHIP-STRUCTURES.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
