      "text": "bending stress:   sigma = M / Z\n        where Z = SECTION MODULUS = I / y\n          I = second moment of area of the hull cross-section\n          y = distance from neutral axis to the deck (or keel)\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SHIP-STRUCTURES.md#017",
      "path": [
        "04-SHIP-STRUCTURES.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:naval-architecture:04-ship-structures, git-history:naval-architecture:04-ship-structures]",
