      "text": "+=================+  <- STRENGTH DECK: thick plate, far from N.A.\n        |                 |     -> carries the most stress, gets the most steel\n        |                 |\n        | - - - - - - - - |  <- NEUTRAL AXIS (zero bending stress)\n        |                 |\n        |                 |\n        +=================+  <- BOTTOM/KEEL: thick plate, far from N.A.\n                                -> double bottom here (also damage protection)"
