      "text": "## Layer 2: The Structural Hierarchy — Three Scales of Strength"
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SHIP-STRUCTURES.md#024",
      "path": [
        "04-SHIP-STRUCTURES.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
