        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ship Structures",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Ship structure is checked at three nested scales. A design can pass the global check and\nstill fail locally, so all three matter."
    },
    {
      "id": "04-SHIP-STRUCTURES.md#025",
      "path": [
